From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:08:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Crash report: say why Tangelo stopped

Tangelo closed a few seconds after a game returned to the HOME Menu with
nothing in the log; Windows only reported ucrtbase.dll exception 0xC0000409
(abort / fail-fast). Crash handlers for uncaught C++ exceptions and
std::terminate, abort(), invalid C runtime arguments and (Windows) unhandled
access violations now write the reason and the call stack as module+offset
to the log and to log/tangelo_crash.txt, finish writing the log (at most 3 s)
and then end the process.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
